@startuml seq-b-failover
title Вариант 2: failover push -> SMS, отказ SMS-агрегатора A
autonumber
participant "Temporal\nCluster" as T
participant "Delivery\nOrchestrator" as O
participant "Push\nGateway" as PG
participant "FCM / APNs" as FCM
participant "SMS\nGateway" as SG
participant "SMS-агрегатор A" as A
participant "SMS-агрегатор B" as B
participant "Receipt API" as RA
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Receipt\nRouter" as RR

O -> T: ScheduleActivity(SendPush)
T -> PG: activity task
PG -> FCM: send(token, apns-collapse-id / tag, ttl=10s)
FCM --> PG: message_id
PG --> T: completed
O -> T: StartTimer(10s) + ожидание signal Delivered
note over FCM: устройство офлайн,\nчерез 10 с FCM отбрасывает push по ttl
...10 секунд без квитанции...
T -> O: workflow task (TimerFired)
O -> T: ScheduleActivity(SendSms, queue=sms,\nretry: 3 попытки, backoff 200 мс..2 с)
T -> SG: activity task
SG -> A: send(phone, text, client_msg_id=nid:sms)
A --> SG: 503
note over SG: circuit breaker агрегатора A открыт\n(5 ошибок за 10 с), дальше трафик идёт в B
SG -> B: send(phone, text, client_msg_id=nid:sms)
B --> SG: accepted(msg_id)
SG -> K: delivery-events(SMS_SENT, provider=B)
SG --> T: completed
T -> O: workflow task
O -> T: StartTimer(120s) + ожидание signal Delivered
B -> RA: DLR delivered(msg_id)
RA -> K: receipts
K -> RR: receipts
RR -> T: SignalWorkflow(notification_id, Delivered{sms})
T -> O: workflow task (signal)
O -> T: CancelTimer; EmitEvent(DELIVERED, channel=sms); CompleteWorkflow
alt DLR failed или таймер 120 с сработал
  O -> T: ScheduleActivity(SendEmail, queue=email)
  note right of O: после email: UNCONFIRMED или FAILED,\nалерт; workflow ждёт поздние квитанции до 1 ч
end
alt квитанция push пришла после перехода на SMS
  RR -> T: SignalWorkflow(Delivered{push})
  note right of O: фиксируется метрика cross_channel_duplicate
end
@enduml
